## Third-party attribution

This project's architecture and event/rule/agent protocol are inspired by
**agent-autoloop** (https://github.com/KKKKhazix/agent-autoloop), distributed under the MIT License.
Its license and copyright notice are retained in `agent-autoloop-wb-dsh/LICENSE`.

`agent-autoloop-wb-dsh` is an independent Windows implementation; no upstream source code was copied verbatim
beyond the protocol shape described in `docs/architecture.md`.

The design guidelines under `docs/design-rules.md` summarize ideas from
Nutlope/hallmark and elayadesign/ai-design-skills; their content is **not** redistributed here
(see `docs/design-skills/README.md`).
